{"id":2916899287,"name":"Blackhawk Rescue Mission 5","desc":"Blackhawk Rescue Mission 5 is a tactical openworld shooter with vast maps and thrilling gameplay. Engage in team-based combat throughout multiple openworld gamemodes, including the new Kingdom of Sawang map. Go head to head in PvP or even build out your own Headquarters to boost your income offline and research powerful weapons.\n\n• Customize your operator with over 1000+ unique outfit combinations.\n• Build your dream gun with 70+ choices and over 100 attachments. \n• Purchase and own 20+ vehicles, boats and helicopters from modern militaries. \n• Multiple engaging gamemodes with many hours of fun ahead.\n• Make your own custom scenarios and maps with the Sandbox Mode. [Realtime Game Editor]\n\nPC, Console, and Mobile are supported. \nHeadphones recommended for best audio experience. All music is non-copyright and streamer safe.\n\nBased on PlatinumFive's original Military RP games.","path":"/game/2916899287-blackhawk-rescue-mission-5","slug":"2916899287-blackhawk-rescue-mission-5","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bf10322bb98041d76bb70e2f2d5fb7e61209597d0898ff5d894f7a06932f4966.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a41e82a66bf9b7d40a8a8f8f1594eb8a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12492,"visitor":642936303,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-27T15:18:57.145Z","creator":{"name":"PLATINUM FIVE","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":63,"freeCount":46,"keyCount":24,"verifiedCount":2},"page":4,"next":null,"total":4,"totalPages":4,"scripts":[{"_id":"6777631f360de4f5cfe60e19","title":"VERY BASIC  ESP","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7864c","gameId":2916899287,"name":"Blackhawk Rescue Mission 5","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bf10322bb98041d76bb70e2f2d5fb7e61209597d0898ff5d894f7a06932f4966.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a41e82a66bf9b7d40a8a8f8f1594eb8a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"2916899287-blackhawk-rescue-mission-5","path":"/game/2916899287-blackhaw